      "note": [
        "The delimitation of the metropolitan areas has been revised as from 2005-01-01. Greater Stockholm has been expanded with the municipalities of Norrtälje, Nykvarn, Nynäshamn and Södertälje and now coincides with Stockholm county. Greater Göteborg has been expanded with the municipalities of Alingsås and Lilla Edet. Greater Malmö has been expanded with the municipalities of Eslöv, Höör och Skurup.",
